# PvP Lobby Clients (Expo)

- Keep `app/pvp.tsx` thin; API + realtime session live under `src/features/pvp`.
- REST rehydrate on every invitation/room hint. Websocket is best-effort.
- Use Laravel tickets + room grants. Never treat `connection.ready` as room membership.
- No PvP combat, rankings, or XP UI in Phase 5B.1 — show honest lobby-ready copy.
